  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi>A</mi></math> is a square matrix and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></math> is an identity matrix of the same order. If <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=O,</mo></math>&nbsp;then inverse of matrix <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
